#: manual/api/shared.md:1
msgid "shared API"
msgstr "shared API"

#: manual/api/shared.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/shared` holds the vocabulary that every other package of the module uses: backend targets, execution modes, ordering guarantees, execution policies and their validation, the declared capabilities of each backend, native status codes, and integer-coded records that mirror the C request structs. It has no dependencies besides the core library and builds on every target."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/shared` 包含本模块其他所有包都使用的词汇：后端目标、执行模式、顺序保证、执行策略及其验证、各后端声明的能力、原生状态码，以及镜像 C 请求结构体的整数编码记录。除核心库外它没有任何依赖，可以在所有目标上构建。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:12
msgid "The enumerations and records of this package are read-only outside it: match on their constructors and read their fields, but build values with the functions below. The reasons behind the policy rules and the status-code mapping are in the [shared design](../design/shared.md)."
msgstr "本包的枚举和记录在包外是只读的：可以对其构造器做模式匹配并读取其字段，但请用下面的函数构建值。策略规则和状态码映射背后的理由见 [shared 设计](../design/shared.md)。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:19
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "把该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/shared.md:27
msgid "The examples on this page call it as `@shared`."
msgstr "本页的示例以 `@shared` 调用它。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:29
msgid "Targets, modes and orderings"
msgstr "目标、模式与顺序"

#: manual/api/shared.md:33
msgid "The runtime that executes a plan or workflow."
msgstr "执行计划或工作流的运行时。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:44
msgid "Whether a submission blocks until it finishes."
msgstr "提交是否阻塞到完成为止。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:55
msgid "Whether results must keep the order of the input."
msgstr "结果是否必须保持输入的顺序。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:64
msgid "`native_target`, `javascript_target`, `synchronous_mode`, `asynchronous_mode`, `preserve_input_order` and `relaxed_order`"
msgstr "`native_target`、`javascript_target`、`synchronous_mode`、`asynchronous_mode`、`preserve_input_order` 和 `relaxed_order`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:66
msgid "Return `Native`, `JavaScript`, `Synchronous`, `Asynchronous`, `PreserveInputOrder` and `RelaxedOrder`."
msgstr "返回 `Native`、`JavaScript`、`Synchronous`、`Asynchronous`、`PreserveInputOrder` 和 `RelaxedOrder`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:80
msgid "Returns `\"native\"` or `\"javascript\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"native\"` 或 `\"javascript\"`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:93
msgid "Execution policies"
msgstr "执行策略"

#: manual/api/shared.md:97
msgid "How a plan or workflow should run: backend, mode, number of workers, chunk size and ordering."
msgstr "计划或工作流应如何运行：后端、模式、工作线程数、块大小和顺序。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:110
msgid "`PolicyIssue` and `PolicyError`"
msgstr "`PolicyIssue` 和 `PolicyError`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:112
msgid "A reason why a policy is outside the v1 subset, and the error that carries the first such reason."
msgstr "策略超出 v1 子集的一个原因，以及携带第一个此类原因的错误。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:130
msgid "Builds a policy and returns the first problem as a `PolicyError`."
msgstr "构建一个策略，并把第一个问题作为 `PolicyError` 返回。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:136
msgid "The defaults are `Native`, `Synchronous`, `1`, `1` and `PreserveInputOrder`. The checks run in the order `worker_count > 0`, `chunk_size > 0`, `backend == Native`, `mode == Synchronous`; the ordering is not checked."
msgstr "默认值依次为 `Native`、`Synchronous`、`1`、`1` 和 `PreserveInputOrder`。检查顺序为 `worker_count > 0`、`chunk_size > 0`、`backend == Native`、`mode == Synchronous`；顺序本身不检查。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:142
msgid "Builds a policy like `make_execution_policy` and aborts when it would return an error, for example for `worker_count=0` or `backend=JavaScript`. Use `make_execution_policy` when the arguments come from outside the program."
msgstr "像 `make_execution_policy` 一样构建策略，并在其本应返回错误时中止，例如 `worker_count=0` 或 `backend=JavaScript`。当参数来自程序外部时，请使用 `make_execution_policy`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:150
msgid "`native_policy` and `javascript_policy`"
msgstr "`native_policy` 和 `javascript_policy`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:152
msgid "Return the default native policy, and attempt the same for the JavaScript backend."
msgstr "返回默认的原生策略，以及为 JavaScript 后端做同样尝试的结果。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:160
msgid "`native_policy()` is `make_execution_policy().unwrap()`. `javascript_policy()` is `make_execution_policy(backend=JavaScript).unwrap()`."
msgstr "`native_policy()` 就是 `make_execution_policy().unwrap()`。`javascript_policy()` 是 `make_execution_policy(backend=JavaScript).unwrap()`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:163
msgid "[!WARNING] `javascript_policy()` aborts on every call in v1, because `make_execution_policy` rejects the JavaScript backend. It exists so that code written for the planned backend compiles; do not call it."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 在 v1 中每次调用 `javascript_policy()` 都会中止，因为 `make_execution_policy` 拒绝 JavaScript 后端。它的存在是为了让面向规划中后端编写的代码能够编译；不要调用它。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:170
msgid "Returns every issue of an existing policy, in the order of the checks above."
msgstr "按上述检查的顺序返回已有策略的所有问题。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:176
msgid "`ExecutionPolicy` is read-only outside this package, so the functions above are the only way to obtain one, and each of them either returns a policy that passes every check or aborts. Outside `shared`, `validate_policy` therefore always returns `[]`. It exists as a defensive re-check: `@workflow.validate` calls it on the policy stored in a workflow, and the [shared design](../design/shared.md) derives why the result is empty."
msgstr "`ExecutionPolicy` 在本包之外是只读的，因此上面这些函数是获得策略的唯一途径，而它们要么返回通过所有检查的策略，要么中止。因此在 `shared` 之外，`validate_policy` 总是返回 `[]`。它作为防御性的复查而存在：`@workflow.validate` 会对工作流中保存的策略调用它，[shared 设计](../design/shared.md)推导了结果为何为空。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:185
msgid "Returns `true` when the policy asks for more than one worker."
msgstr "当策略要求不止一个工作线程时返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:205
msgid "Runtime capabilities"
msgstr "运行时能力"

#: manual/api/shared.md:209
msgid "The features a backend declares."
msgstr "后端声明的特性。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:222
msgid "Returns the declared table of a backend."
msgstr "返回后端声明的能力表。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:228
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端"

#: manual/api/shared.md:228
msgid "Parallelism"
msgstr "并行"

#: manual/api/shared.md:228
msgid "Async"
msgstr "异步"

#: manual/api/shared.md:228
msgid "Zero-copy buffers"
msgstr "零拷贝缓冲区"

#: manual/api/shared.md:233
msgid "The table is a fixed declaration, not a probe of the running system. The native row declares parallelism, but the `moon` build compiles the C runtime without OpenMP, so the kernels run on one thread there; only the workflow scheduler starts threads. The JavaScript entries describe the backend the specification plans; the JavaScript backend executes nothing yet."
msgstr "该表是固定的声明，而不是对运行中系统的探测。原生一行声明了并行，但 `moon` 构建在编译 C 运行时时没有启用 OpenMP，因此在该构建中内核在单个线程上运行；只有工作流调度器会启动线程。JavaScript 一行描述的是规范所规划的后端；JavaScript 后端目前什么也不执行。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:239
msgid "Native status codes"
msgstr "原生状态码"

#: manual/api/shared.md:243
msgid "The status codes 0 to 7 of the C runtime."
msgstr "C 运行时的状态码 0 到 7。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:258
msgid "`native_status_code` and `native_status_from_code`"
msgstr "`native_status_code` 和 `native_status_from_code`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:260
msgid "Convert between `NativeStatus` and its C code."
msgstr "在 `NativeStatus` 与其 C 编码之间转换。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:267
msgid "`native_status_code` numbers the constructors 0 to 7 in declaration order. `native_status_from_code` inverts it on 0 to 7 and maps every other code, including the workflow statuses 8 to 14, to `InvalidArgument`."
msgstr "`native_status_code` 按声明顺序把构造器编号为 0 到 7。`native_status_from_code` 在 0 到 7 上是它的逆，并把其他所有编码（包括工作流状态码 8 到 14）映射为 `InvalidArgument`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:282
msgid "Integer-coded native records"
msgstr "整数编码的原生记录"

#: manual/api/shared.md:284
msgid "These records mirror the C structs `luna_thread_buffer`, `luna_thread_map_request`, `luna_thread_reduce_request` and `luna_thread_scan_request` field by field, with enumerations as `Int` codes. No package of the module consumes them; `backend/native` uses its own typed records. They store their arguments unchecked."
msgstr "这些记录逐字段镜像 C 结构体 `luna_thread_buffer`、`luna_thread_map_request`、`luna_thread_reduce_request` 和 `luna_thread_scan_request`，枚举以 `Int` 编码表示。本模块中没有包使用它们；`backend/native` 使用自己的带类型记录。它们不检查地保存参数。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:292
msgid "A pointer, as an `Int`, and a length."
msgstr "一个以 `Int` 表示的指针和一个长度。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:306
msgid "Input and output buffers, element count, value type code, worker count and chunk size."
msgstr "输入和输出缓冲区、元素数、值类型编码、工作线程数和块大小。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:327
msgid "The constructor takes the fields in declaration order."
msgstr "构造函数按声明顺序接受各字段。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:329
msgid "`NativeReduceRequest` and `NativeScanRequest`"
msgstr "`NativeReduceRequest` 和 `NativeScanRequest`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:331
msgid "The same fields as `NativeMapRequest` plus a reduction kernel code, placed after the value type."
msgstr "字段与 `NativeMapRequest` 相同，另外在值类型之后多一个归约内核编码。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:381
#: manual/api/workflow.md:500
msgid "Equality and package information"
msgstr "相等性与包信息"

#: manual/api/shared.md:385
msgid "Structural equality, promoted on every type of the package: `BackendTarget`, `ExecutionMode`, `ExecutionPolicy`, `NativeBuffer`, `NativeMapRequest`, `NativeReduceRequest`, `NativeScanRequest`, `NativeStatus`, `OrderingGuarantee`, `PolicyError`, `PolicyIssue` and `RuntimeCapabilities`. Use `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "结构相等，作为方法提升到本包的每个类型上：`BackendTarget`、`ExecutionMode`、`ExecutionPolicy`、`NativeBuffer`、`NativeMapRequest`、`NativeReduceRequest`、`NativeScanRequest`、`NativeStatus`、`OrderingGuarantee`、`PolicyError`、`PolicyIssue` 和 `RuntimeCapabilities`。请使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:397
msgid "Returns `\"shared\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"shared\"`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:1
msgid "workflow API"
msgstr "workflow API"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow` describes a task graph: a set of capabilities (channels, locks, barriers and shared data), a set of nodes that compute or synchronise, and dependency edges between nodes. It validates the graph and records submissions. It executes nothing itself and builds on every target; `backend/native` runs workflows."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow` 用于描述任务图：一组能力（通道、锁、屏障和共享数据）、一组进行计算或同步的节点，以及节点之间的依赖边。它验证图并记录提交。它本身不执行任何东西，可以在所有目标上构建；工作流由 `backend/native` 运行。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:11
msgid "The enumerations and records of this package are read-only outside it: match on their constructors and read their fields, but build values with the functions below. The graph model and the reasoning behind the checks are in the [workflow design](../design/workflow.md)."
msgstr "本包的枚举和记录在包外是只读的：可以对其构造器做模式匹配并读取其字段，但请用下面的函数构建值。图模型以及各项检查背后的推理见 [workflow 设计](../design/workflow.md)。"

