msgstr "返回 `\"workflow\"`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: manual/architecture.md:3
msgid "This guide shows how the MoonBit packages, the C runtime and the JavaScript addon of `luna_thread` fit together, and which integer codes cross the foreign function interface. The package pages describe each MoonBit package in detail."
msgstr "本指南说明 `luna_thread` 的 MoonBit 包、C 运行时和 JavaScript 插件如何组合在一起，以及哪些整数编码会跨越外部函数接口。各个包页面详细描述了每个 MoonBit 包。"

#: manual/architecture.md:7
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "层次"

#: manual/architecture.md:9
msgid "The specification names two realization paths:"
msgstr "规范列出了两条实现路径："

#: manual/architecture.md:16
msgid "The first path exists. The second stops at the MoonBit side: `backend/js` names the JavaScript target, and the addon in `js/` exports only a `runtimeName` function."
msgstr "第一条路径已经存在。第二条路径止步于 MoonBit 一侧：`backend/js` 只给出 JavaScript 目标，`js/` 中的插件只导出一个 `runtimeName` 函数。"

#: manual/architecture.md:20
msgid "The MoonBit packages depend on each other without cycles:"
msgstr "MoonBit 包之间的依赖没有环："

#: manual/architecture.md:22
msgid "Package"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/architecture.md:22
msgid "Imports"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/architecture.md:24
msgid "nothing but the core library"
msgstr "只有核心库"

#: manual/architecture.md:31
msgid "`shared` holds the vocabulary every other package uses: backend targets, execution modes, ordering guarantees, execution policies and their validation, runtime capability tables, and integer-coded mirrors of the C request structs."
msgstr "`shared` 包含其他所有包都使用的词汇：后端目标、执行模式、顺序保证、执行策略及其验证、运行时能力表，以及 C 请求结构体的整数编码镜像。"

#: manual/architecture.md:35
msgid "`plan` describes one data-parallel operation over a typed input domain and checks it against the v1 subset."
msgstr "`plan` 描述作用于带类型输入域的单个数据并行操作，并按 v1 子集检查它。"

#: manual/architecture.md:37
msgid "`workflow` describes a task graph whose nodes may be compute plans or synchronisation steps bound to capabilities, and checks its structure."
msgstr "`workflow` 描述一个任务图，其节点可以是计算计划，也可以是绑定到能力的同步步骤，并检查其结构。"

#: manual/architecture.md:39
msgid "`backend/native` translates plans into typed native requests, calls the C kernels, and marshals workflows to the C scheduler."
msgstr "`backend/native` 把计划转换为带类型的原生请求，调用 C 内核，并把工作流编组后交给 C 调度器。"

#: manual/architecture.md:41
msgid "`core`, the root package, re-exports the common entry points with defaults and routes submissions to the native backend."
msgstr "根包 `core` 以默认值重新导出常用入口，并把提交路由到原生后端。"

#: manual/architecture.md:44
msgid "The C runtime"
msgstr "C 运行时"

#: manual/architecture.md:46
msgid "The runtime is one C file with one header:"
msgstr "运行时由一个 C 文件和一个头文件组成："

#: manual/architecture.md:48
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: manual/architecture.md:48
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: manual/architecture.md:50
msgid "Public C API: status codes, request structs, workflow types."
msgstr "公开的 C API：状态码、请求结构体、工作流类型。"

#: manual/architecture.md:51
msgid "Kernels, validation and the workflow scheduler."
msgstr "内核、验证和工作流调度器。"

#: manual/architecture.md:52
msgid "The same source, compiled as a MoonBit native stub; it differs only in its `#include` path."
msgstr "同一份源码，作为 MoonBit 原生桩编译；它只有 `#include` 路径不同。"

#: manual/architecture.md:53
msgid "`luna_mbt_*` wrappers that turn MoonBit arguments into request structs."
msgstr "把 MoonBit 参数转换为请求结构体的 `luna_mbt_*` 包装函数。"

#: manual/architecture.md:54
msgid "Declarations of the `luna_mbt_*` wrappers."
msgstr "`luna_mbt_*` 包装函数的声明。"

#: manual/architecture.md:55
msgid "A C smoke test of the kernels and of their failure statuses."
msgstr "内核及其失败状态的 C 冒烟测试。"

#: manual/architecture.md:57
msgid "The two copies of the runtime must be kept identical by hand."
msgstr "运行时的两份副本必须手工保持一致。"

#: manual/architecture.md:59
msgid "There are two builds. `moon` compiles the stubs with the system C compiler and no OpenMP flags, so the `#pragma omp` loops run on the calling thread, while the workflow scheduler still starts POSIX threads. CMake (`make native-configure`, `make native-build`) builds `native/` as a static library with OpenMP when `LUNA_THREAD_ENABLE_OPENMP` is on, together with the smoke test. The [native backend design](design/backend/native.md) explains both execution models."
msgstr "有两种构建方式。`moon` 用系统 C 编译器编译桩，且不带 OpenMP 选项，因此 `#pragma omp` 循环在调用线程上运行，而工作流调度器仍会启动 POSIX 线程。CMake（`make native-configure`、`make native-build`）在开启 `LUNA_THREAD_ENABLE_OPENMP` 时把 `native/` 构建为启用 OpenMP 的静态库，并一同构建冒烟测试。[原生后端设计](design/backend/native.md)解释了这两种执行模型。"

#: manual/architecture.md:67
msgid "Codes across the interface"
msgstr "跨越接口的编码"

#: manual/architecture.md:69
msgid "All enumerations cross the C interface as `Int`. The MoonBit side maps them in `backend/native` (and `shared` for statuses)."
msgstr "所有枚举都以 `Int` 的形式跨越 C 接口。MoonBit 一侧在 `backend/native` 中映射它们（状态码则在 `shared` 中）。"

#: manual/architecture.md:72
msgid "Status codes"
msgstr "状态码"

#: manual/architecture.md:74
#: manual/architecture.md:102
msgid "Code"
msgstr "编码"

#: manual/architecture.md:74
msgid "C name"
msgstr "C 名称"

#: manual/architecture.md:74
msgid "MoonBit `NativeStatus`"
msgstr "MoonBit `NativeStatus`"

#: manual/architecture.md:92
msgid "Codes 8 to 14 come only from the workflow runtime; `WorkflowResult::status` carries them as raw integers. The current runtime never produces codes 2, 3, 10 and 11. Codes 8 and 9 reject a graph at submission, and through `submit_workflow_async` they are visible only as an empty handle. Code 13 is returned only for a `Wait` in a graph without capabilities, which admission already rejects, so in practice the failures a running workflow reports are 12 (`Unlock` of a free mutex) and 14 (a barrier group of one node)."
msgstr "状态码 8 到 14 只来自工作流运行时；`WorkflowResult::status` 以原始整数携带它们。当前运行时从不产生状态码 2、3、10 和 11。状态码 8 和 9 在提交时拒绝图，而通过 `submit_workflow_async` 只能看到一个空句柄。状态码 13 只会在没有能力的图中对 `Wait` 返回，而准入阶段已经拒绝了这种图，因此实践中运行中的工作流报告的失败只有 12（对空闲的互斥锁执行 `Unlock`）和 14（只有一个节点的屏障组）。"

