msgid "Value types are `0` for `I32` and `1` for `I64`; reduction kernels are `0` for `Sum`, `1` for `Min` and `2` for `Max`."
msgstr "值类型 `I32` 为 `0`，`I64` 为 `1`；归约内核 `Sum` 为 `0`，`Min` 为 `1`，`Max` 为 `2`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:120
