#: manual/index.md:83
msgid "The [architecture guide](architecture.md) spans the packages: it shows how the MoonBit packages, the C runtime in `native/` and the Node.js addon in `js/` fit together, and lists the integer codes that cross the foreign function interface."
msgstr "[架构指南](architecture.md)横跨各个包：它展示 MoonBit 包、`native/` 中的 C 运行时和 `js/` 中的 Node.js 插件如何组合在一起，并列出跨越外部函数接口的整数编码。"

#: manual/index.md:88
msgid "Exported entry points"
msgstr "导出的入口"

#: manual/index.md:90
msgid "The facade re-exports the common names; each package page lists the rest."
msgstr "门面重新导出常用名称；其余名称由各包页面列出。"

#: manual/index.md:92
msgid "Policies: `make_policy`, `default_policy`, `default_backend`, `runtime_capabilities`, and in `shared` `ExecutionPolicy`, `make_execution_policy` and `validate_policy`"
msgstr "策略：`make_policy`、`default_policy`、`default_backend`、`runtime_capabilities`，以及 `shared` 中的 `ExecutionPolicy`、`make_execution_policy` 和 `validate_policy`"

#: manual/index.md:95
msgid "Plans: `map`, `reduce`, `scan`, `map_reduce`, `validate`, `is_ready`, the value types `i32_type` … `opaque_type` and the kernels `sum_reduction`, `min_reduction` and `max_reduction`"
msgstr "计划：`map`、`reduce`、`scan`、`map_reduce`、`validate`、`is_ready`，值类型 `i32_type` … `opaque_type`，以及内核 `sum_reduction`、`min_reduction` 和 `max_reduction`"

#: manual/index.md:98
msgid "Workflows: `workflow`, `compute_task`, `spawn_task`, `join_task`, `channel_capability`, `mutex_capability`, `shared_read_capability`, `workflow_validate`, `workflow_is_ready` and `submit_workflow`; the full node, edge and capability vocabulary is in `workflow`"
msgstr "工作流：`workflow`、`compute_task`、`spawn_task`、`join_task`、`channel_capability`、`mutex_capability`、`shared_read_capability`、`workflow_validate`、`workflow_is_ready` 和 `submit_workflow`；完整的节点、边和能力词汇见 `workflow`"

#: manual/index.md:103
msgid "Execution"
msgstr "执行"

#: manual/index.md:105
msgid "Direct kernels: `execute_map_i32`, `execute_reduce_sum_i32` and `execute_scan_sum_i32` on `FixedArray[Int]`; the `Int64`, minimum and maximum kernels are the `ffi_*` functions of `backend/native`"
msgstr "直接内核：作用于 `FixedArray[Int]` 的 `execute_map_i32`、`execute_reduce_sum_i32` 和 `execute_scan_sum_i32`；`Int64`、最小值和最大值内核是 `backend/native` 的 `ffi_*` 函数"

#: manual/index.md:108
msgid "Asynchronous workflows: `submit_workflow_async`, `poll_workflow`, `wait_workflow` and `drop_workflow`"
msgstr "异步工作流：`submit_workflow_async`、`poll_workflow`、`wait_workflow` 和 `drop_workflow`"

#: manual/index.md:110
msgid "Plans translate into typed native requests with `map_request_from_plan`, `reduce_request_from_plan` and `scan_request_from_plan`; no function executes a plan yet"
msgstr "计划通过 `map_request_from_plan`、`reduce_request_from_plan` 和 `scan_request_from_plan` 转换为带类型的原生请求；目前还没有函数会执行计划"

#: manual/index.md:114
msgid "Where to read next"
msgstr "接下来读什么"

#: manual/index.md:116
msgid "If you want to run something, start with the [core tutorial](tutorial/core.md): it doubles, sums and scans an array on the native backend and builds a small workflow."
msgstr "如果你想运行点什么，请从 [core 教程](tutorial/core.md)开始：它在原生后端上对数组做翻倍、求和与扫描，并构建一个小型工作流。"

#: manual/index.md:120
msgid "New to the package: read the [core tutorial](tutorial/core.md), then the [plan tutorial](tutorial/plan.md) and the [workflow tutorial](tutorial/workflow.md) to see what a plan or a workflow means before you build one."
msgstr "初次接触本包：先阅读 [core 教程](tutorial/core.md)，再阅读 [plan 教程](tutorial/plan.md)和 [workflow 教程](tutorial/workflow.md)，在构建计划或工作流之前先了解它们的含义。"

#: manual/index.md:123
msgid "Using it in a library: keep the [core API](api/core.md), the [plan API](api/plan.md) and the [workflow API](api/workflow.md) at hand. Write library code against `plan` and `workflow`, which build on every target, and leave execution to the application."
msgstr "在库中使用：把 [core API](api/core.md)、[plan API](api/plan.md) 和 [workflow API](api/workflow.md) 放在手边。基于可在所有目标上构建的 `plan` 和 `workflow` 编写库代码，把执行留给应用程序。"

#: manual/index.md:127
msgid "Contributing: read the [architecture guide](architecture.md) and the design pages, in particular the [native backend design](design/backend/native.md) for the threading and memory model, then the specification above."
msgstr "参与贡献：阅读[架构指南](architecture.md)和各设计页面，特别是关于线程模型和内存模型的[原生后端设计](design/backend/native.md)，然后阅读上面的规范。"

#: manual/index.md:133
msgid "Run the release checks from the module directory:"
msgstr "在模块目录中运行发布检查："

#: manual/index.md:140
msgid "`native/tests/smoke.c`, built by `make native-configure native-build`, checks the C kernels on their own."
msgstr "由 `make native-configure native-build` 构建的 `native/tests/smoke.c` 会单独检查 C 内核。"

