#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:3
msgid "This tutorial gets you calling the native backend directly: you run the typed kernels, reach the `Int64`, minimum and maximum kernels through the raw foreign functions, turn plans into native requests, and run a workflow on the C scheduler."
msgstr "本教程带你直接调用原生后端：运行带类型的内核，通过原始外部函数使用 `Int64` 内核以及最小值和最大值内核，把计划转换为原生请求，并在 C 调度器上运行工作流。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:10
msgid "double, sum or prefix-sum an `Int` array"
msgstr "对 `Int` 数组做翻倍、求和或前缀和"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:11
msgid "work on `Int64`, or take a minimum or maximum"
msgstr "处理 `Int64`，或求最小值或最大值"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:11
msgid "the `@native.ffi_execute_*` functions"
msgstr "`@native.ffi_execute_*` 函数"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:12
msgid "check a plan against what the C runtime implements"
msgstr "按 C 运行时的实现检查计划"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:12
msgid "`@native.map_request_from_plan` and its siblings"
msgstr "`@native.map_request_from_plan` 及其同类函数"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:13
msgid "run a workflow on threads"
msgstr "在线程上运行工作流"

